OL,3,GNEWSAFears of warehouse 'tsunami' as
OL,4,Aanother is approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to extend a warehouse facility in
OL,7,Fthe countryside have been approved,
OL,8,Fdespite concerns of "an unstoppable
OL,9,Ftsunami of warehouse developments".
OL,11,FSaica Pack was given permission by
OL,12,FReform-led North Northamptonshire
OL,13,FCouncil to erect a large storage
OL,14,Fbuilding next to its existing warehouse
OL,15,Fin Thrapston.
OL,17,FThe company, which produces corrugated
OL,18,Fpackaging, said it would no longer need
OL,19,Fto transport the finished goods to
OL,20,Fother sites in Corby and Sywell.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
